# Allowlist for the Studio image build context (BuildKit prefers <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# over .dockerignore). Only the generated Studio bundle and its nginx config may enter the
# context: content/ (and so every unapproved video), guide.html and the legacy internal
# index.html are excluded, and .dockerignore's `**/dist` rule does not apply to this build.
*
!Dockerfile.studio
!nginx.studio.conf
!dist/studio
